WEBVTT

00:04.070 --> 00:05.900
Oh! It looks delicious!

00:05.900 --> 00:07.740
Yes, it is!

00:08.100 --> 00:11.070
Please enjoy the food, everyone.

00:11.070 --> 00:12.530
Bon appétit!

00:14.040 --> 00:17.580
This hamburger is so juicy!
So delicious!

00:17.580 --> 00:20.380
It's more delicious than the one
in the town's restaurant.

00:20.380 --> 00:22.960
Lady Rys is becoming better at cooking.

00:22.960 --> 00:26.460
Oh, my.
Thank you for your compliment.

00:26.460 --> 00:28.930
This is all thanks to Miss Mileno.

00:29.330 --> 00:31.510
Are you still attending cooking class?

00:31.510 --> 00:35.720
The person who was teaching me back then
visited Houghtow the other day.

00:35.720 --> 00:38.230
So I went there to say hello.

00:38.230 --> 00:39.730
And then...

00:40.730 --> 00:42.480
Miss Mileno.

00:42.480 --> 00:45.730
Oh, it's been a while, Rys!

00:45.730 --> 00:49.650
I'm here to say thank you.

00:49.650 --> 00:50.700
For what?

00:51.030 --> 00:52.410
For this!

00:52.730 --> 00:59.500
I was able to catch my husband's heart
thanks to your guidance.

00:59.860 --> 01:02.710
Oh, my! Congratulations, Rys!

01:02.710 --> 01:07.990
Then, as a present,
I will teach you family meals.

01:09.190 --> 01:12.760
She was so quick-witted.

01:12.760 --> 01:17.180
She even taught me to cook meals
that children really love.

01:17.180 --> 01:18.770
Children...

01:18.770 --> 01:22.150
Well, there's a possibility
since you two are married.

01:22.150 --> 01:24.190
Yeah, right.

01:29.130 --> 01:29.940
Yes?

01:32.410 --> 01:33.740
You are...

01:33.740 --> 01:37.410
First Princess Elizabeth?
What are you doing here?

01:37.830 --> 01:41.000
I already said
I'm not interested in being the hero.

01:41.000 --> 01:44.000
Pardon my sudden intrusion.

01:44.000 --> 01:48.000
I came to apologize
to you today, Sir Flio.

01:48.390 --> 01:52.630
No... Sir Banaza, the hero candidate
who was summoned here.

02:09.690 --> 02:21.450
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

03:26.980 --> 03:28.860
#9 A WOLF AND AN ADVENTURER

03:28.860 --> 03:31.480
#9 A WOLF AND AN ADVENTURER
I don't know if this fits

03:31.480 --> 03:33.360
to your liking, Your Highness.

03:33.360 --> 03:35.490
P-Please try it.

03:35.490 --> 03:36.320
Thank you.

03:36.700 --> 03:37.910
I will drink it.

03:39.370 --> 03:44.540
Please forgive me, but I have something
important to discuss with Sir Flio.

03:44.540 --> 03:46.960
Would you kindly leave us?

03:46.960 --> 03:48.450
Understood.

03:48.450 --> 03:50.420
No, I don't want to!

03:50.860 --> 03:54.880
Do you know how poorly your kingdom
has treated my husband until now?

03:54.880 --> 03:57.680
I'm not leaving you two together.

03:57.680 --> 03:58.970
Rys...

04:01.920 --> 04:04.560
I understand.
Let's talk.

04:04.560 --> 04:05.560
My Dear!

04:05.980 --> 04:10.190
But I want my wife to be here with me.

04:10.190 --> 04:13.690
If this is something you cannot
discuss in front of my wife,

04:13.690 --> 04:15.330
then please leave our house.

04:21.530 --> 04:23.280
I understand.

04:25.580 --> 04:27.130
Everyone, let's go.

04:35.840 --> 04:38.550
Once again, Sir Banaza...

04:38.550 --> 04:44.720
On behalf of my kingdom, I beg your
forgiveness for many wrongs we did to you.

04:45.140 --> 04:50.690
Especially for the spells
placed on your bottomless bag,

04:50.690 --> 04:55.010
and your exile to the Delaveza Forest.

04:56.900 --> 04:59.400
Please raise your head, Your Highness.

04:59.830 --> 05:03.030
The current me is Flio, not Banaza.

05:03.030 --> 05:05.170
Right now, I'm just a humble merchant.

05:05.810 --> 05:09.400
So you still won't accept my apology?

05:10.310 --> 05:14.290
Your apology won't change anything for me.

05:14.290 --> 05:16.960
Anyway, can we get to the point?

05:17.380 --> 05:22.740
You didn't come all this way
just to say sorry, right?

05:24.600 --> 05:26.600
You've seen right through me.

05:30.180 --> 05:31.190
Please look at this.

05:31.850 --> 05:32.690
What is this?

05:33.270 --> 05:36.590
This is a magic map showing
the positions of the Klyrode Army.

05:37.980 --> 05:43.660
Each of these marks shows an enchanted
stone carried by a battalion leader.

05:44.170 --> 05:47.410
Isn't this a top secret?
Why would you show it to me?

05:48.120 --> 05:54.250
The effect of the Purification that was cast
around the castle town will wear off soon.

05:54.250 --> 05:59.670
When that happens, the Dark Army
will continue their invasion.

06:00.670 --> 06:06.180
However, our mages have yet
to recover their magic.

06:06.610 --> 06:11.660
We could position our troops to use
the geographical advantage,

06:12.230 --> 06:15.270
but doing so would leave some towns
completely vulnerable.

06:15.270 --> 06:21.490
That's why, I am here to ask
for your help to protect the towns.

06:22.490 --> 06:28.490
I can't ask you to fight
as our hero now, but...

06:28.490 --> 06:29.580
Wait!

06:29.580 --> 06:31.870
You're too selfish!

06:31.870 --> 06:34.420
Not only have you been acting
all high and mighty,

06:34.420 --> 06:38.090
but now you want to drag my husband,
who hates strife, into your war!

06:39.300 --> 06:43.640
The King, who has been bedridden due to
using Purification, will wake up soon.

06:44.210 --> 06:51.180
I expect him to send the army after you
for conspiring with the demons.

06:52.180 --> 06:55.140
Is that some kind of threat?

06:55.140 --> 06:56.520
Not at all.

06:56.520 --> 07:01.110
There's something I can do
while I am still acting ruler of Klyrode.

07:01.110 --> 07:02.230
And that is?

07:02.780 --> 07:05.150
The crime of disgracing the true hero.

07:05.150 --> 07:09.270
Furthermore, the crime of
appointing a false hero.

07:09.890 --> 07:13.950
I will have him abdicate the throne
for these crimes.

07:15.950 --> 07:19.960
I humbly ask for your help, Sir Flio.

07:19.960 --> 07:24.050
The King has protected this kingdom
from many dangers.

07:24.470 --> 07:29.680
But on the other hand,
he often discarded those who needed help.

07:30.600 --> 07:34.710
I will reign in his place
so that I can save all my people.

07:35.580 --> 07:41.860
For that sake, I need to show that I can
command the army as well as the King.

07:41.860 --> 07:46.070
You just want to use my husband
to make yourself a ruler!

07:46.070 --> 07:47.810
Calm down, Rys.

07:49.320 --> 07:53.950
You just need a guarantee that
I won't join the Dark Army, right?

07:54.830 --> 07:57.670
As expected, you've seen right
through me once again.

07:57.670 --> 07:59.710
What do you mean?

07:59.710 --> 08:06.880
What's the point of her showing me who has
ties with her enemy's vital information?

08:09.340 --> 08:12.350
She wants you to stay quiet
and don't cause trouble?

08:12.800 --> 08:13.930
Correct.

08:14.520 --> 08:19.200
From the start, she didn't count me
as part of her force.

08:19.940 --> 08:21.310
Isn't that right?

08:21.980 --> 08:26.780
I do not want to abandon those towns.
That is my true feeling as well.

08:27.240 --> 08:32.990
You didn't think about the possibility
of me telling this to the demons?

08:32.990 --> 08:38.250
Please take it as a sign of
total trust from us.

08:38.740 --> 08:44.210
Please grant me your help, Sir Flio.

08:46.880 --> 08:48.670
Damn it! We lost them!

08:48.670 --> 08:51.010
I'm pretty sure they were
from the wanted list.

08:51.010 --> 08:53.720
I took my eyes off them for a second,
and they were gone.

08:57.930 --> 08:59.350
They're gone.

09:00.690 --> 09:05.820
We finally got out of that hole,
but now we have to run around again.

09:05.820 --> 09:08.240
I'm tired already!

09:08.240 --> 09:09.320
Don't cry!

09:09.320 --> 09:12.990
I'm not the kind of person
who should be caught in a place like this.

09:12.990 --> 09:17.330
In order to return as a hero,
I must now shake off my pursuers!

09:19.540 --> 09:22.000
I'm hungry too!

09:22.000 --> 09:24.000
I told you not to cry!

09:24.000 --> 09:26.420
Oh, well...

09:27.170 --> 09:27.880
Here.

09:28.330 --> 09:30.260
Are you sure?

09:30.260 --> 09:33.590
We don't have much food left.

09:33.590 --> 09:35.300
Just eat it.

09:35.300 --> 09:37.180
Thank you very much.

09:37.610 --> 09:44.020
I'm amazed that you're still
willing to follow me, Tsuya.

09:44.020 --> 09:48.150
I could say that to you.

09:48.510 --> 09:53.860
It would have been easier to escape
if you weren't with a burden like me, right?

09:54.870 --> 09:57.240
Well, maybe you're right.

09:57.240 --> 10:01.710
I don't want to be imprisoned
all the time, either.

10:01.710 --> 10:02.960
Besides...

10:03.420 --> 10:07.750
When you opened
the door of the prison cell,

10:08.340 --> 10:11.170
you were kind of cool, you know?

10:13.220 --> 10:17.180
Although you did a lot of things poorly.

10:17.180 --> 10:18.640
Shut up!

10:18.640 --> 10:22.230
I don't care if I'm the hero or not!
If I die, everything will be over!

10:22.230 --> 10:23.690
There were no other options.

10:24.190 --> 10:25.400
Come on, let's go!

10:28.440 --> 10:30.530
Sir Hero!

10:30.530 --> 10:31.570
Tsuya!

10:33.820 --> 10:36.040
W-What is this?!

10:39.200 --> 10:44.000
I was looking for sacrifices,
and I found a good-looking guy.

10:52.760 --> 10:55.430
My Dear, can I go over there?

10:55.430 --> 10:58.310
Huh? Sure.

11:01.970 --> 11:05.600
You were thinking about
the Princess's offer?

11:05.600 --> 11:06.600
Yeah.

11:06.980 --> 11:09.940
The truth is,
I really don't like fighting.

11:09.940 --> 11:17.030
But I can't stand still when I know
some towns are in danger.

11:17.570 --> 11:19.070
My Dear...

11:19.070 --> 11:22.080
And I've been wondering

11:22.080 --> 11:26.940
about what I need to do
or want to do in this world.

11:27.780 --> 11:31.300
If we have kids,

11:31.300 --> 11:37.130
I want them to live with smiles alongside
the human's and demon's kids.

11:37.510 --> 11:39.720
I have to make such a world for them.

11:40.260 --> 11:42.640
I know that it would be very difficult.

11:42.640 --> 11:48.100
But if that's something I could do,
then I would do anything for it.

11:48.690 --> 11:53.320
I'm sure you can tackle things
that seem impossible.

11:53.800 --> 11:58.030
And I will help you as much as I can.

11:59.070 --> 12:01.670
Thank you, Rys.

12:09.540 --> 12:14.510
There's an army approaching from
the forest near the northeast entrance!

12:14.510 --> 12:16.050
The Dark Army is coming!

12:16.050 --> 12:17.840
Evacuate as quickly as possible!

12:17.840 --> 12:19.430
Let's hurry!

12:41.870 --> 12:43.910
Run while you have the chance.

12:46.790 --> 12:49.620
I said I would help,

12:49.620 --> 12:53.070
but I can't believe you accepted such
a troublesome task without compensation.

12:53.070 --> 12:55.130
You're too soft.

12:55.550 --> 13:00.970
If I accept the reward, they'd say that
we were bought by the humans.

13:00.970 --> 13:05.220
The second I agree to hear
the Princess is the moment I lose.

13:05.220 --> 13:10.060
Huh?! You lose to her?
Then you're going to be her husband?

13:10.060 --> 13:11.350
I'm not!

13:11.350 --> 13:16.150
Some demons do take multiple wives.

13:16.150 --> 13:18.650
What about me?

13:18.650 --> 13:20.650
Like I said, I'm not marrying her!

13:20.650 --> 13:23.820
Why is a lupine taking
the side of humans?

13:23.820 --> 13:25.490
Who the hell are you?!

13:25.490 --> 13:27.240
We are the protectors of this town.

13:27.700 --> 13:30.960
I won't hurt you if you turn back.

13:30.960 --> 13:35.960
However, if you harm town people,
I won't show you mercy.

13:35.960 --> 13:39.340
Show us no mercy?
Don't make us laugh!

13:39.340 --> 13:41.260
Don't underestimate us,
you weak human!

13:41.260 --> 13:43.260
I'm not underestimating you all.

13:43.260 --> 13:46.310
I'm telling you because
we're going to waste our energy.

13:46.310 --> 13:50.890
Look, none of you can even
pierce this Barrier.

13:54.230 --> 13:55.860
Move!

13:57.980 --> 14:00.280
I will crush this barrier to bits.

14:00.820 --> 14:02.820
It's a cyclops.

14:02.820 --> 14:05.910
The most powerful tribe
in the Dark Army,

14:05.910 --> 14:09.120
and the servant of Yuigarde,
Ghozal's brother.

14:09.120 --> 14:11.120
A lupine, huh?

14:11.120 --> 14:16.310
Your top dog was one of the Infernal Four,
yet he's dumb enough to die.

14:16.310 --> 14:18.090
How useless.

14:19.250 --> 14:21.300
You are not my opponent!

14:21.300 --> 14:26.140
My Dear, would you leave this to me?

14:26.140 --> 14:27.140
Rys...

14:27.490 --> 14:31.060
My brother, Fengaryl,
was indeed defeated.

14:31.060 --> 14:36.150
Since he was one of the Infernal Four,
it's a given for him to take the blame.

14:36.150 --> 14:39.150
But if my brother's defeat
has caused our tribe,

14:39.150 --> 14:44.360
who are proud of our strength,
to be belittled,

14:44.360 --> 14:47.950
then I, as his sister,
will not stand idly by.

14:48.360 --> 14:51.080
Listen up, you arrogant fool.

14:51.080 --> 14:53.910
I will remind you which tribe
is the strongest.

14:54.460 --> 14:57.040
I don't think it's a good idea.

14:57.040 --> 15:02.760
If this is important to you,
then it's not my place to butt in.

15:02.760 --> 15:04.880
But don't kill them, okay?

15:04.880 --> 15:07.260
I understand.

15:08.720 --> 15:15.560
A dog who can only bark!
Just let this barrier protect you!

15:15.990 --> 15:19.900
You will never hit me
with those big swings!

15:19.900 --> 15:20.940
Damn you!

15:28.740 --> 15:33.370
You really think you can win
if the only thing you do is just bite me?

15:33.370 --> 15:36.420
Indeed, with that thick muscle of yours,

15:36.420 --> 15:40.460
beating you without killing
will take some work.

15:40.460 --> 15:44.590
If it's the old me,
I would take care of you instantly.

15:45.010 --> 15:48.090
But now, I know how to hold
my strength.

15:48.090 --> 15:49.300
What?

15:49.300 --> 15:51.650
So be grateful to my husband!

15:52.810 --> 15:54.640
Meteoric Leap!

15:58.400 --> 16:00.020
Positional Exchange!

16:01.940 --> 16:05.190
You made me swap places with you?!

16:05.190 --> 16:08.990
But this won't be enough to beat me!

16:11.330 --> 16:12.830
Positional Exchange!

16:16.960 --> 16:23.300
No matter how thick your muscles are,
it's easy to gouge out a wound.

16:23.920 --> 16:25.260
Gravitation!

16:28.590 --> 16:30.340
Done nailing.

16:30.340 --> 16:33.470
I know it's impossible,
but do you still want to do it?

16:34.430 --> 16:38.140
Using dirty tricks like humans
even though you are a demon!

16:38.140 --> 16:42.770
If I hadn't used these dirty tricks,
you'd be dead already.

16:42.770 --> 16:44.320
Damn you!

16:44.320 --> 16:46.990
Why are you standing around like that?!

16:46.990 --> 16:49.990
Crush her! Don't let this traitor
get away with it!

16:52.450 --> 16:53.830
That's enough!

16:55.120 --> 16:56.950
I can't move!

16:59.920 --> 17:04.170
You should have let me handle them.

17:04.170 --> 17:06.260
The duel is over.

17:06.260 --> 17:08.670
So there's no need to fight anymore.

17:08.670 --> 17:11.800
I know how strong you are, Rys.

17:11.800 --> 17:14.300
Oh, my! Dear!

17:14.300 --> 17:15.530
Healing.

17:19.890 --> 17:21.600
What do you want?!

17:21.990 --> 17:24.820
I already told you
that I'd like you to turn back.

17:25.400 --> 17:29.570
I could send you all back
to the Delaveza Forest with Teleportation.

17:29.570 --> 17:32.030
But you'll come back here, right?

17:32.030 --> 17:34.910
So I want you
to leave of your own volition.

17:34.910 --> 17:37.330
I don't get it.

17:37.330 --> 17:39.540
Who the hell are you?

17:40.290 --> 17:45.250
I'm just a normal human who has
a special relationship with this demon.

17:47.430 --> 17:50.300
I'd really like to get along
with you, too.

17:50.800 --> 17:53.550
But if you don't want to listen,

17:54.640 --> 17:56.930
then I'm going to keep
standing in your way...

17:58.060 --> 18:00.180
...until all of you back down.

18:07.230 --> 18:09.360
Somehow I managed to send them back.

18:09.360 --> 18:12.570
You looked so cool earlier!

18:12.930 --> 18:16.780
All the practice we did at home paid off.

18:17.910 --> 18:21.410
The most important thing
in a fight is pressure!

18:21.410 --> 18:23.500
You've got to shock them!

18:23.500 --> 18:24.500
Huh?

18:24.500 --> 18:27.670
Hands on hips, chin up 45 degrees!

18:27.670 --> 18:30.510
I will make you able to beat
your opponent with just your eyes!

18:31.880 --> 18:34.800
That made me more nervous than
any negotiation I've ever had.

18:34.800 --> 18:38.240
However, was it really enough?

18:39.220 --> 18:43.770
They will strike again as soon
as they are ordered to.

18:43.770 --> 18:50.070
We should've hurt them badly enough to
discourage them from doing this again.

18:50.070 --> 18:51.610
Rys...

18:52.190 --> 18:57.200
Indeed, that would be the fastest way
to prevent them from coming back.

18:57.200 --> 19:03.000
But that would increase the hatred
between humans and demons.

19:03.000 --> 19:06.000
Hatred?

19:06.000 --> 19:08.390
Excuse me.

19:09.340 --> 19:13.840
Thank you for saving our town.

19:14.150 --> 19:18.100
But, about that wolf...

19:18.610 --> 19:20.680
There is no need to worry about her.

19:21.180 --> 19:23.560
She's my partner.

19:26.310 --> 19:27.650
U-Umm...

19:28.060 --> 19:32.360
Thank you for saving me back then.

19:33.500 --> 19:35.860
I'm glad that you're not hurt.

19:36.330 --> 19:40.170
We came here at the request
of the First Princess.

19:40.750 --> 19:42.490
You should thank her.

19:42.490 --> 19:44.040
The First Princess?

19:44.040 --> 19:46.960
How kind of her!

19:52.630 --> 19:54.260
I'm here to report.

19:54.880 --> 20:01.100
There's a mysterious adventurer who drives away
the Dark Army from many regions.

20:01.450 --> 20:04.180
A mysterious adventurer?
What is their identity?

20:04.640 --> 20:07.520
He is said to be
accompanied by a silver wolf,

20:07.520 --> 20:10.400
and his face is hidden
by a wolf-like mask.

20:10.810 --> 20:15.570
After he drove off the Dark Army,
he vanished without even introducing himself.

20:15.570 --> 20:18.950
Just like that?
Without asking for money or anything?

20:18.950 --> 20:19.950
Yes.

20:19.950 --> 20:24.080
He claimed to have been asked
by the First Princess.

20:24.460 --> 20:28.210
We've received letters of gratitude
from these regions.

20:29.620 --> 20:32.540
Could it be that adventurer...

20:32.540 --> 20:36.320
Yes, there's no doubt.
That must be him.

20:36.910 --> 20:40.390
Sir Flio has heeded my request.

20:41.330 --> 20:44.100
Send word to our armies in every region.

20:44.100 --> 20:49.480
If they meet this adventurer,
help him as much as they can.

20:49.480 --> 20:50.100
Yes!

20:50.520 --> 20:53.370
Sir Flio has done this much for us.

20:54.050 --> 20:57.190
Now, I have to pay him back.

21:02.130 --> 21:03.620
Damn it, Yuigarde.

21:04.030 --> 21:06.700
He acted without my order.

21:07.160 --> 21:08.460
Lord Gholl!

21:09.040 --> 21:10.710
Sorry to disturb you.

21:10.710 --> 21:13.630
I've got an urgent message
from Lady Uliminas.

21:14.040 --> 21:14.880
What is it?

21:14.880 --> 21:17.710
Lord Yuigarde is staging a coup.

21:17.710 --> 21:21.130
He and his entourage have seized
the throne room.

21:23.970 --> 21:26.560
Phufun, are all preparations in order?

21:26.560 --> 21:27.390
Yes.

21:27.390 --> 21:32.060
Fortunately, we have picked up a pair
of humans with high capabilities.

21:32.060 --> 21:36.150
When we confront Lord Gholl,
we'll deploy the secret technique,

21:36.610 --> 21:40.740
the Superhybridization ritual to borrow
the power of the Evil God.

21:40.740 --> 21:44.620
They will be the offerings
for the Evil God.

21:44.620 --> 21:46.370
Save me!

21:46.370 --> 21:49.370
I won't let you get away with this!

21:49.370 --> 21:52.040
No matter how strong Lord Gholl is,

21:52.040 --> 21:57.000
with this ritual,
you will definitely win against him.

21:57.800 --> 22:02.190
Now, come here quickly, Gholl.

22:02.790 --> 22:07.140
Once I've defeated you,
this throne will be mine.

23:40.940 --> 23:42.150
This is the First Princess.

23:42.150 --> 23:46.700
Why am I all alone when the next
episode preview is always so lively?

23:46.700 --> 23:49.780
Even though I have a name,
I'm still listed as the "First Princess."

23:49.780 --> 23:51.580
I know that feeling, First Princess!

23:51.580 --> 23:52.450
Golden-Haired Hero!

23:52.450 --> 23:55.410
I felt that pain, too!

